sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Controller as BookController
    participant Service as BookDetailQueryService
    participant EbookRepo as EbookRepository
    participant ChapterRepo as ChapterRepository
    participant VolumeRepo as VolumeRepository

    Client->>+Controller: GET /library/book?bookid=209
    Controller->>Controller: 参数校验 (BookIdRequest)
    Controller->>+Service: getBookDetail(209)

    par 并发查询 (Promise.all)
        Service->>+EbookRepo: findById(209)
        EbookRepo-->>-Service: 返回图书基础信息
        Service->>+ChapterRepo: findIntroduction(209)
        ChapterRepo-->>-Service: 返回简介内容
        Service->>+ChapterRepo: findByBookId(209)
        ChapterRepo-->>-Service: 返回章节列表(Index)
        Service->>+VolumeRepo: findByBookId(209)
        VolumeRepo-->>-Service: 返回分卷列表(Volumes)
    end

    Service->>Service: 组装 BookDetail DTO
    Service-->>-Controller: 返回完整数据
    Controller-->>-Client: 200 OK (统一包装格式)